WEBVTT

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:32.190
You

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:46.920
Storm over Kilimanjaro, the time has come for the Radish to take its leave of the dock ship Le Vion Rose, while the Argama remains behind to continue further repairs.

00:02:08.510 --> 00:02:12.100
Don't touch him! He's broken, because you dropped him.

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:17.200
Jumping around.

00:02:18.020 --> 00:02:19.000
Yeah, you're right.

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:23.950
Broken, Camille.

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:26.030
Sim!

00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:28.200
I'm a little tired and kind of busy.

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:29.960
Get out! You haven't done any...

00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:31.690
since we docked with the Levee on Rose,

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:32.930
so how can you be tired?

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:34.490
Oh, really?

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:35.990
You spying for Captain Bright?

00:02:36.230 --> 00:02:37.070
No way.

00:02:37.270 --> 00:02:39.150
Please, just try.

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:40.210
Not right now.

00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:44.790
Look, even I get tired or have things to think about sometimes.

00:02:45.090 --> 00:02:45.810
Spoil sport!

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:50.620
If you want the children to stay aboard the ship,

00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:52.700
you'd better find a place to hide them for a while.

00:02:53.260 --> 00:02:55.940
Personnel from the Levee on Rose will be inspecting us shortly.

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:57.300
I'll take care of it.

00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:05.320
He's no fun.

00:03:05.440 --> 00:03:07.700
He's not busy, but he doesn't want to fix Haro.

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:08.860
Camille doesn't want to?

00:03:14.550 --> 00:03:16.330
All right, all right, I'll do it.

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:17.510
What's with you?

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:27.720
It's going to take me a little while.

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:27.980
Thanks.

00:03:33.290 --> 00:03:36.200
Camille, this is very immature of you.

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:39.140
Little kids are always asking for stuff.

00:03:39.340 --> 00:03:40.900
That's not what I'm talking about.

00:03:41.140 --> 00:03:42.400
What are you so mad about?

00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:45.820
You're not the only one who's grieving over Ms. Recoa's death, you know.

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:47.720
But don't go taking it out on the children.

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:49.620
And blaming the lieutenant like that?

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:50.720
You should be ashamed.

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:51.780
No, that isn't it.

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:53.240
I'm just tired, that's all.

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:56.400
Well, we're resupplied.

00:03:56.870 --> 00:03:58.150
And now for Kilimanjaro.

00:03:58.940 --> 00:03:59.940
This is the joint opera.

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:04.060
We have no choice but to follow the schedule they've set up from Earth.

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:08.850
We'll just have to do it. Well, now that Mr. Wong's not on board.

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:10.040
Less stressful?

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:11.440
You can say that again.

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:24.030
This is the course the Argama will take.

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:28.550
The Kilimanjaro attack is mainly a Karaba operation.

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:29.960
While the Argama will...

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.980
We'll only be there to provide covering fire from orbit.

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:32.960
Returning to Earth?

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:34.040
In case they required our mobile suits...

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:35.600
Where former Asame was.

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:38.500
But we don't expect our mobile suit team to see any action.

00:04:38.890 --> 00:04:39.970
We're not going down?

00:04:40.150 --> 00:04:41.230
Weren't you paying attention?

00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:42.540
I was.

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:46.150
How can we just stand on the sidelines while Karaba members get killed?

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:47.800
I explained this.

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:49.740
Sounds like cowardice to me, Lieutenant.

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:51.040
Camille, that's enough.

00:04:51.320 --> 00:04:53.680
Your attitude costs Ensyn Rekawa her life.

00:04:53.880 --> 00:04:55.500
You weren't listening to the briefing.

00:04:56.390 --> 00:04:57.730
This is a Titan stronghold.

00:04:58.240 --> 00:04:59.980
The Argama doesn't have the mobile suit.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.300
to take on Kilimanjaro.

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:05.330
I understand your frustration,

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:06.690
but think about this logically.

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:09.060
Karaba has its own mobile suits.

00:05:09.460 --> 00:05:12.320
The Agama's only mission is to draw Kilimanjaro's attention to space.

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:13.260
Camille, come back!

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:15.780
I don't like it, but I'll go along with the operation.

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:25.780
Sorry. All hands proceed to the mobile suit deck.

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:32.920
All I can think about is going back down to Earth.

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:39.620
Guess I shouldn't have taken it out on Lieutenant Quatro.

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:49.670
Just don't go breaking it again.

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:50.570
We won't.

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:52.270
I've decided to give it to you, kids.

00:05:57.890 --> 00:05:59.330
Bessie's giving Haro to us.

00:05:59.350 --> 00:05:59.970
He is?

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:03.020
That's very generous, Camille.

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:03.900
My pleasure.

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:06.640
Fa, would you mind looking after Ms. Requa's cactus?

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:10.020
Not at all. Why?

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:11.730
No reason. Bye.

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:29.420
So these are the Barzams.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.200
Looks like you got a lot of them.

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:32.040
Yes, sir.

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:35.060
And the mechanics seem like they're already up to speed on them.

00:06:35.570 --> 00:06:37.010
I'm gonna enjoy this, Gaudi.

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:39.800
Thanks for your cooperation, Captain.

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:41.690
Uh, right.

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:45.440
Just try to be careful of anti-air crossfire from Earth.

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:50.640
I guess they can't tell the difference between friend and foe from Kilimanjaro.

00:06:51.130 --> 00:06:51.570
Exactly.

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:58.800
This Yazan is taking just about all of our Barzans.

00:06:59.220 --> 00:06:59.960
I don't know, sir.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.460
Can he handle them?

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:04.520
Shiraka was the one who ordered Yazan after the Argama.

00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:07.260
I don't think he did it just to get rid of him.

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:11.400
I'm Brabby and Barzam teams. Move out.

00:07:13.350 --> 00:07:29.580
How's our course?

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:33.020
Attention all mobile suits. Standby to launch.

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:35.400
Synchronizing everyone's clocks for the operation.

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:41.750
Hey Camille, if you get to Earth, buy me another holotape, would you?

00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:45.100
We're not gonna land. We're only providing support from orbit.

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:47.020
I don't think it's gonna be that simple.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:48.480
There are... Missiles incoming!

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:50.740
I see missile tracks from Earth, sir.

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:52.960
Free from portside.

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:55.160
Caesar, trace their original launch point.

00:07:59.130 --> 00:07:59.970
Looks like the connection...

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:04.760
island sir prepare air to surface missiles launch ballistic missiles at

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:20.310
Kilimanjaro I mean make a particle cannons friggin continent coming into

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:22.580
view sir watch for anti-air missiles

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:39.880
We'll move in when the anti-air fire dies down.

00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:41.260
Our target is the Zeta.

00:08:41.970 --> 00:08:43.330
We'll use the Sea Serpent.

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:45.260
The Farzams will take the others.

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:47.180
Enemy mobile suits detected.

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:48.560
About ten of them, sir.

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:51.800
Deploy our mobile suits and make sure our gunners know

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:54.760
their land-based missiles aren't likely to hit us.

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:56.140
Continue intercepting.

00:09:00.090 --> 00:09:01.900
Gundam, Kamiya launching.

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:11.300
Yakushiki launching, mobile suits don't lag behind.

00:09:16.850 --> 00:09:18.990
Umbra units, spread out to the side.

00:09:20.480 --> 00:09:29.860
This weird shining stuff.

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:35.980
You can't move, Zayna!

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:40.430
Camille, no!

00:09:41.110 --> 00:09:47.040
Lieutenant, get your rifle!

00:10:01.150 --> 00:10:01.570
Lieutenant!

00:10:07.240 --> 00:10:10.370
Stop. We've already carried out Scirocco's orders.

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:12.150
Any further in, you'll burn up.

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:15.460
The Hiyaku Shiki's falling, and Camille's chasing it, sir.

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:17.480
Camille, do you read me?

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:21.520
The Hiyaku Shiki's out of control. Earth's gravity's pulling it in.

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:23.640
Join with Caravan. Do you understand?

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:26.980
I want anti-air fire directed against the enemy mobile suits.

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:29.980
One hit and I'm completely...

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:57.240
out of whack don't think this is gonna end well try not to lean outside of the shock wave roger

00:10:57.240 --> 00:10:59.260
we'll head straight for kilimanjaro

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:21.780
Tactical cannons, increase your barrage.

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:23.320
Mobile suit teams, prepare to drop.

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:24.600
They're coming in ahead of us.

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:53.100
doing great here that's Kilimanjaro looks like Caraba are throwing everything they have at it

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:56.570
but they still haven't been able to take the mountain

00:12:15.350 --> 00:12:17.550
Let's take another route. It's too dangerous here.

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:19.590
Is the Hiyaku Shiki still operational?

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:24.000
A few dents in the body. Let's take a roundabout way to the summit.

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:26.300
But we're going to be joining Karaba, aren't we?

00:12:26.540 --> 00:12:28.100
We should head straight for the talk.

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:29.980
I don't want to be shot down by...

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:52.990
friendly fire beauty ruined are we defending here that's right isn't that

00:12:52.990 --> 00:12:59.080
thing ready yet just about ready your excellency I want to see it in action but

00:12:59.080 --> 00:12:59.920
sir we're in

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:11.930
middle of a battle I realize that mobile suits in the rear take the left side of

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:13.670
the mountain try to outflank the enemy

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:48.040
Why are we stopping here? Is your mobile suit okay?

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:49.510
Take a look at this water.

00:13:49.860 --> 00:13:50.940
It's only a lake.

00:13:51.590 --> 00:13:58.620
It isn't frozen. This could be the reservoir for the Kilimanjaro base.

00:13:58.860 --> 00:13:59.680
Their reservoir?

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:06.490
Camille, let's dive in.

00:14:06.890 --> 00:14:07.150
Right.

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:10.320
What? What's this feeling?

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:19.050
Psycho Gundam.

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:21.980
Psycho Gundam?

00:14:43.470 --> 00:14:43.850
Could she?

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:47.900
No, 4 is not in it.

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:53.050
There's something about this Psycho Gundam feels different from the one in Hong Kong.

00:14:59.280 --> 00:14:59.980
She's not there.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:03.030
Someone completely different is operating it.

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:03.670
Camille!

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:04.780
Sir?

00:15:05.020 --> 00:15:08.220
There's a pipeline in the back. Stay here and watch the suits while I take a look.

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:13.110
Lieutenant!

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:27.180
Four isn't dead. She's alive.

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:40.350
Why did you follow me?

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:45.120
If anything goes wrong and we're caught, the Titans will get both our mobile suits.

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:48.210
I just didn't want to leave everything in your hands.

00:15:54.290 --> 00:15:55.250
Smells like oil.

00:15:57.360 --> 00:15:59.760
How can they just dump everything in the water like that?

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:02.680
Don't complain. The negligence helped us get in here.

00:16:03.790 --> 00:16:04.530
What is it, Camille?

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:07.700
You mean you can't hear that?

00:16:13.870 --> 00:16:14.290
Hear what?

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:16.440
Someone's shouting. Or more like screaming.

00:16:24.010 --> 00:16:24.430
Opening!

00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:55.370
It's powerful thought waves, Camille. It would be dangerous to go any further.

00:16:56.180 --> 00:16:57.760
How can you be so sure of that?

00:16:58.030 --> 00:16:59.190
I've experienced this.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:01.640
But we still have to check it out, don't we?

00:17:01.990 --> 00:17:03.010
I'm carrying on.

00:17:03.110 --> 00:17:03.470
Camille.

00:17:19.770 --> 00:17:20.870
Is this all there is?

00:17:20.990 --> 00:17:21.690
Uh, no, sir.

00:17:22.170 --> 00:17:23.070
Increase the intensity.

00:17:29.760 --> 00:17:29.980
Dis-

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:34.890
Disappointed the psycho waves are already in the red zone. It would be dangerous to increase them

00:17:35.100 --> 00:17:42.250
That's not what I'm suggesting at all sir if she can't even handle this level of intensity then it will never work

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:51.390
Okay, turn this thing off. I understand that it's brainwave controlled

00:17:51.390 --> 00:17:59.400
But we'd need several times the power for effective remote control. I know that but at that level you destroy the pilot's body

00:18:02.360 --> 00:18:04.220
Do real new types have the same problem?

00:18:04.620 --> 00:18:07.460
She'll have no problem operating it from inside the cockpit.

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:09.080
I guarantee it.

00:18:09.240 --> 00:18:10.360
I should hope so.

00:18:14.220 --> 00:18:14.800
They're gone.

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:15.260
What are?

00:18:15.770 --> 00:18:17.630
The thought waves that were in this direction.

00:18:18.220 --> 00:18:18.700
You're right.

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:25.300
Jump!

00:18:30.990 --> 00:18:49.010
They sealed it, Tov.

00:18:49.880 --> 00:18:53.490
Chamaton, is this the man who ordered Commodore Blex's death?

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:56.400
It's certainly a surprise to see you here, Char.

00:18:56.870 --> 00:18:59.480
Or is it Lieutenant Quattro?

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:02.230
Your time has come, you think so?

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:11.520
He's locked it.

00:19:12.470 --> 00:19:16.050
Is this the end of the Red Comet?

00:19:16.610 --> 00:19:17.930
Such a sad way to go.

00:19:18.430 --> 00:19:20.470
I expected more of a challenge from you.

00:19:28.030 --> 00:19:29.400
War? Is it you?

00:19:33.870 --> 00:19:34.250
Four.

00:19:34.580 --> 00:19:35.400
I understand.

00:19:35.680 --> 00:19:38.160
The tests in the cockpit are much easier.

00:19:38.340 --> 00:19:38.940
Four, it's me!

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:40.760
It's Camille Bidane!

00:19:41.800 --> 00:19:42.500
Let's move!

00:19:43.070 --> 00:19:43.450
Wait!

00:19:44.060 --> 00:19:50.030
I won't get open!

00:19:50.280 --> 00:19:51.840
Only Four can open that door!

00:19:51.980 --> 00:19:52.960
Well, go in from the outside!

00:19:54.180 --> 00:19:55.580
Four, can't you hear me?

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:56.680
It's me!

00:19:57.070 --> 00:19:57.590
I know.

00:19:57.750 --> 00:19:59.830
The next phase is to go outside and fight.

00:20:01.240 --> 00:20:02.720
Stop it! She can't hear you!

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:03.960
I'll make her remember!

00:20:04.200 --> 00:20:05.100
Get out of the way!

00:20:05.960 --> 00:20:07.120
No, Lieutenant! Stop!

00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:09.190
Don't get close to her!

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:11.630
You're aware she's a cyber-new type, aren't you?

00:20:12.900 --> 00:20:14.600
What prince does that make?

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:17.530
That girl has possessed you!

00:20:17.790 --> 00:20:20.810
Please, Thor, let's talk before you go out there to fight!

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:28.230
I don't understand what's going on.

00:20:28.350 --> 00:20:29.730
I just have to get through to her.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:34.420
If she is a cyber-new type, then she's being forced to fight through artificial mind control.

00:20:34.680 --> 00:20:36.020
We just have to fix that.

00:20:36.280 --> 00:20:38.100
You have to at least give her a chance.

00:20:38.810 --> 00:20:39.450
Come here.

00:20:42.860 --> 00:20:43.200
Wait!

00:20:43.730 --> 00:20:43.950
Don't!

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:46.120
It's in the water pipe.

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:47.260
We have to get out.

00:20:47.420 --> 00:20:47.860
More!

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:54.660
Any word on those mobile suits that came down from space?

00:20:54.940 --> 00:20:55.620
Nothing yet.

00:20:56.420 --> 00:20:58.120
They must have been shot down.

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:26.800
shape! Psycho Gundam! Hey, that's Camille and Char down there! Psycho Gundam! Look at this! Enemy

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:28.940
suits everywhere, like I thought there'd be!

00:21:30.960 --> 00:21:41.350
Okay! Tell it me!

00:21:44.440 --> 00:21:47.300
It's all your fuck to suffer like this!

00:21:50.940 --> 00:21:52.100
Away from her, Camille!

00:21:52.220 --> 00:21:52.920
You're to blame!

00:21:55.740 --> 00:21:58.290
Move away! That Gundam's dangerous!

00:21:58.810 --> 00:21:59.330
Amuro!

00:22:04.700 --> 00:22:05.240
Fall back!

00:22:09.420 --> 00:22:10.700
I'm surprised you came.

00:22:10.990 --> 00:22:12.190
But you're pleased to see Camille?

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:16.960
You should never have let them see each other.

00:22:17.930 --> 00:22:19.850
Are you talking about that girl, Four?

00:22:21.190 --> 00:22:22.850
You know the danger very well.

00:22:23.580 --> 00:22:26.140
How could you stand to let the same thing happen again?

00:23:47.180 --> 00:23:52.730
is unable to free herself from the psycho gundam and while she's being held in camille's arms

00:23:52.730 --> 00:23:55.730
she can't even understand her own fate humanity

00:24:00.188 --> 00:24:01.868
still has a long way to go.

00:24:05.340 --> 00:24:10.720
Next on Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam Forever 4, you will see the tears of time.
